(text "Buttons to GND, the Pico's internal pull-ups. Up/down/left/right, A (Select,\nheld to sign), B (Back), Y (Reject): the Waveshare board's keys, same GPIOs.\nEach switch is wired on a diagonal (pads 1 and 2), so it works whichever\npair of legs the maker joins inside; the other two pads carry no net." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 35.56 182.88 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "540933b7-4e08-4981-88fc-822bc4ff6a45"))
